Reduce your {lungs} to 0 (do not incur any {wound-facedown}), then give another Investigator the {poppet} (Poppet) token
Each time the Poppet gains a {blood}, you may remove a {wound-facedown}
Each time the Poppet loses 1 or more {lungs}, you may gain 1 {lungs}
You may not Trade this Item after using it
